msgid "<a0>J3 Verify, import and schedule at the home clinic</a0>: Evaluate the national schedule ({code0})"
msgstr "<a0>J3 在所属诊所验证、导入并安排接种计划</a0>：评估国家接种计划（{code0}）"

#: input/pagecontent/decision-logic.md:13
#, python-brace-format
msgid "<a0>J3 Verify, import and schedule at the home clinic</a0>: Evaluate the national schedule ({code0}); Give due doses and book the next visit ({code1})"
msgstr "<a0>J3 在所属诊所验证、导入并安排接种计划</a0>：评估国家接种计划（{code0}）；接种到期剂次并预约下次就诊（{code1}）"

#: input/pagecontent/decision-logic.md:14
msgid "<a0>STD-ACC-001</a0>"
msgstr "<a0>STD-ACC-001</a0>"

#: input/pagecontent/decision-logic.md:103
msgid "<a0>STD-ACC-001</a0> (expiry): a link opened outside the holder's period (J4: 2026-10-26 to 2026-11-09, Consent TrustDemoJ4Consent) releases nothing."
msgstr "<a0>STD-ACC-001</a0>（有效期）：在持有人设定的期限之外打开的链接不释放任何内容（J4：2026-10-26 至 2026-11-09，Consent TrustDemoJ4Consent）。"

#: input/pagecontent/decision-logic.md:104
msgid "<a0>STD-ACC-001</a0> (passcode): a wrong passcode releases nothing and is logged at home (AuditEvent TrustDemoJ41WrongPasscode)."
msgstr "<a0>STD-ACC-001</a0>（通行码）：错误的通行码不释放任何内容，并在本国记录日志（AuditEvent TrustDemoJ41WrongPasscode）。"

#: input/pagecontent/decision-logic.md:102
msgid "<a0>STD-ACC-001</a0> (revoke): a withdrawn link releases nothing; the attempt is logged."
msgstr "<a0>STD-ACC-001</a0>（撤销）：已撤回的链接不释放任何内容；该尝试会被记录日志。"

#: input/pagecontent/decision-logic.md:13
msgid "<a0>STD-SCH-001</a0>"
msgstr "<a0>STD-SCH-001</a0>"

#: input/pagecontent/decision-logic.md:12
msgid "<a0>STD-SCH-001</a0>, <a1>STD-SEM-001</a1>"
msgstr "<a0>STD-SCH-001</a0>，<a1>STD-SEM-001</a1>"

#: input/pagecontent/decision-logic.md:70
msgid "<a0>STD-SCH-001</a0>: counted by its schedule code and date, wherever it was given (J3: TrustDemoJ3HepB, TrustDemoJ3Bcg)."
msgstr "<a0>STD-SCH-001</a0>：无论在何处接种，均按其接种计划编码和日期计数（J3：TrustDemoJ3HepB、TrustDemoJ3Bcg）。"

#: input/pagecontent/decision-logic.md:11
msgid "<a0>STD-SEM-001</a0>"
msgstr "<a0>STD-SEM-001</a0>"

#: input/pagecontent/decision-logic.md:51
msgid "<a0>STD-SEM-001</a0> (map): the published national map has an equivalent; both codings are kept, as in TrustDemoJ3Bcg."
msgstr "<a0>STD-SEM-001</a0>（映射）：已发布的国家映射表中有对应项；两种编码都保留，如 TrustDemoJ3Bcg 所示。"

#: input/pagecontent/decision-logic.md:53
msgid "<a0>STD-SEM-001</a0> (unmapped): no equivalent is known, and none is guessed."
msgstr "<a0>STD-SEM-001</a0>（未映射）：没有已知的对应项，也不作任何猜测。"

#: input/pagecontent/decision-logic.md:10
msgid "<a0>STT-VER-001</a0>, <a1>STT-VER-006</a1>, <a2>STT-VER-008</a2>, <a3>STT-VER-011</a3>"
msgstr "<a0>STT-VER-001</a0>，<a1>STT-VER-006</a1>，<a2>STT-VER-008</a2>，<a3>STT-VER-011</a3>"

#: input/pagecontent/decision-logic.md:15
msgid "<a0>STT-VER-001</a0>, <a1>STT-VER-008</a1>, <a2>STT-VHL-009</a2>, <a3>STT-VHL-005</a3>"
msgstr "<a0>STT-VER-001</a0>，<a1>STT-VER-008</a1>，<a2>STT-VHL-009</a2>，<a3>STT-VHL-005</a3>"

#: input/pagecontent/decision-logic.md:120
msgid "<a0>STT-VER-008</a0>: the typed result names the step and reason, for example a DSC missing from the cached trust list (<a1>STT-VER-006</a1>). The clinician records why it was not verified."
msgstr "<a0>STT-VER-008</a0>：类型化的结果会指明步骤和原因，例如缓存的信任列表中缺少某个 DSC（<a1>STT-VER-006</a1>）。临床医生记录其未被验证的原因。"

#: input/pagecontent/decision-logic.md:121
msgid "<a0>STT-VHL-009</a0>: an expired link is not followed."
msgstr "<a0>STT-VHL-009</a0>：不跟随已过期的链接。"

#: input/pagecontent/decision-logic.md:10
msgid "<a0>TD.DT.01 What does a scanned DVC become in the child's record?</a0>"
msgstr "<a0>TD.DT.01 扫描的 DVC 在儿童记录中成为什么？</a0>"

