msgid "<a0>TD.DT.03 Does the national schedule count this dose?</a0>"
msgstr "<a0>TD.DT.03 国家接种计划是否计入该剂次？</a0>"

#: input/pagecontent/decision-logic.md:13
msgid "<a0>TD.DT.04 Is this dose of the national schedule due?</a0>"
msgstr "<a0>TD.DT.04 国家接种计划的该剂次是否到期？</a0>"

