msgstr "决策表"

#: input/pagecontent/decision-logic.md:34
msgid "Decoding failed before any signature check (<a0>STT-VER-001</a0> order), so nothing was read: three states, not two, since a bad scan is not evidence either way."
msgstr "解码在任何签名检查之前就已失败（按 <a0>STT-VER-001</a0> 的顺序），因此未读取任何内容：这是三种状态而不是两种，因为扫描失败不能证明任何一方面。"

#: input/pagecontent/decision-logic.md:35
msgid "Do not record a dose from this certificate; record the step and reason; the clinician decides by national policy, as for an undocumented dose."
msgstr "不要根据该证书记录剂次；记录步骤和原因；由临床医生根据国家政策决定，与无记录剂次的处理方式相同。"

