msgstr "失败原因（{code0}）"

#: input/pagecontent/decision-logic.md:75
msgid "For one action of the national schedule, decide whether the evaluation recommends it now, and from which date."
msgstr "对于国家接种计划的某一个动作，决定评估是否建议现在执行，以及从哪个日期开始。"

#: input/pagecontent/decision-logic.md:40
msgid "For one dose, decide whether and how the national schedule code is added beside the issuer's product code, which is always kept."
msgstr "对于某一剂次，决定是否以及如何在签发方的产品编码（始终保留）旁添加国家接种计划编码。"

#: input/pagecontent/decision-logic.md:58
msgid "For one Immunization in the child's record, decide whether the schedule evaluation counts it as given."
msgstr "对于儿童记录中的某一个 Immunization，决定接种计划评估是否将其计为已接种。"

#: input/pagecontent/decision-logic.md:92
msgid "For one manifest request (ITI-YY5), decide whether the portal releases the manifest, and what the access log records."
msgstr "对于某一个清单请求（ITI-YY5），决定门户是否释放清单，以及访问日志记录什么。"

#: input/pagecontent/decision-logic.md:110
msgid "For one scanned VHL, decide whether the receiver requests the manifest or treats the family's records like paper."
msgstr "对于某一个扫描的 VHL，决定接收方是请求清单，还是将该家庭的记录当作纸质记录对待。"

#: input/pagecontent/decision-logic.md:83
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Forecast ({code0})"
msgstr "预测（{code0}）"

#: input/pagecontent/decision-logic.md:20
msgid "From the result of reading one foreign DVC, decide whether its dose is recorded as verified, kept as reported and not verified, or not recorded from it at all."
msgstr "根据读取某个外国 DVC 的结果，决定其剂次是记录为已验证、保留为已报告且未验证，还是根本不据此记录。"

#: input/pagecontent/decision-logic.md:66
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Has a national schedule code ({code0})"
msgstr "具有国家接种计划编码（{code0}）"

#: input/pagecontent/decision-logic.md:118
#, python-brace-format
msgid "HCERT verification result ({code0})"
msgstr "HCERT 验证结果（{code0}）"

#: input/pagecontent/decision-logic.md:31
msgid "Import the dose with primarySource true and a verification Provenance that names the signer's key and removes the reported dose it replaces; then map its vaccine code (TD.DT.02)."
msgstr "以 primarySource true 导入该剂次，并附带一个验证 Provenance，其中指明签名者的密钥，并移除被其替换的已报告剂次；然后映射其疫苗编码（TD.DT.02）。"

#: input/pagecontent/decision-logic.md:45
