msgstr "示例中：<a0>PlanDefinition TrustDemoLaoInfantSchedule</a0>、<a1>ImmunizationRecommendation TrustDemoJ3Recommendation</a1>、<a2>Task TrustDemoJ3Reminder</a2>"

