#: input/pagecontent/decision-logic.md:87
msgid "J3: measles-rubella 1 at 9 months belongs to a later visit and is not in this recommendation."
msgstr "J3：9 个月时的麻疹-风疹第 1 剂属于之后的就诊，不在本次建议中。"

#: input/pagecontent/decision-logic.md:86
msgid "J3: pentavalent 1, bOPV 1 and PCV 1 at 6 weeks, due 2025-12-09 (ImmunizationRecommendation TrustDemoJ3Recommendation), with a reminder Task for that date."
msgstr "J3：6 周时的五联疫苗第 1 剂、bOPV 第 1 剂和 PCV 第 1 剂，到期日 2025-12-09（ImmunizationRecommendation TrustDemoJ3Recommendation），并附带该日期的提醒 Task。"

#: input/pagecontent/decision-logic.md:85
msgid "J3: the Hep B and BCG birth doses count once imported, so they are not recommended again (<a0>STD-SCH-001</a0>)."
msgstr "J3：Hep B 和 BCG 出生剂次一经导入即计入，因此不会再次建议接种（<a0>STD-SCH-001</a0>）。"

#: input/pagecontent/decision-logic.md:31
msgid "J3's yes path (<a0>STT-VER-001</a0>): the dose is recorded from its primary source. Examples Immunization TrustDemoJ3HepB and Provenance TrustDemoJ3Verification."
msgstr "J3 的“是”路径（<a0>STT-VER-001</a0>）：该剂次根据其原始来源记录。示例 Immunization TrustDemoJ3HepB 和 Provenance TrustDemoJ3Verification。"

#: input/pagecontent/decision-logic.md:32
msgid "Keep the dose as reported; record the step and reason (<a0>STT-VER-008</a0>); verify the DVC again after the next trust-list refresh."
msgstr "将该剂次保留为已报告；记录步骤和原因（<a0>STT-VER-008</a0>）；在下次信任列表刷新后再次验证该 DVC。"

#: input/pagecontent/decision-logic.md:33
