#: input/pagecontent/decision-logic.md:6
#, python-brace-format
msgid "The sources are {code0}; this page and the PlanDefinitions are generated from them. The entries use the FEEL subset the harness's decision-table interpreter accepts: {code1} (any), literals, comparisons and one-of. Every table's hit policy is FIRST: the rules are tried in order and the first that matches applies, so the order is part of the logic. Where a rule says \"by national policy\", the policy is the home country's; the tables illustrate the decisions, they are not a country's rules."
msgstr "源文件为 {code0}；本页面和各 PlanDefinition 均由其生成。各条目使用框架（harness）决策表解释器所接受的 FEEL 子集：{code1}（任意）、字面量、比较以及 one-of。每个表的命中策略都是 FIRST：按顺序尝试各规则，第一条匹配的规则生效，因此顺序是逻辑的一部分。凡规则写明“根据国家政策”之处，该政策指本国的政策；这些表用于说明决策，并非某个国家的规则。"

